WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
- How have you personally
been processing it?

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:03.650
Just everything that's happened,

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.240
'cause there's so much!

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.480
- There's so much that yes, everything is,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.620
no pun intended, one day at a time.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.310
And literally, the Coronavirus
was one thing, right?

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.340
That was one thing
about us, being nervous.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.440
It's still here, by the way.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.020
So it's not like it's one thing.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:24.020
It's just that something bigger,
something else is brewing.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.353
And I think that with
the Black Lives Matter,

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:33.840
everybody who is an ally
is doing what they can,

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.450
how they can.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.230
So whether it's protesting,

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:41.060
whether it's donating
to Black Lives Matter,

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.470
whether it's using your platform for it.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.930
- Whether it's listening.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.790
- By the way, that's the most
important thing is listening.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.130
Is sometimes being quiet
and listening to what it is.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.280
Listening, stop being
so defensive about it.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.700
Black Lives Matter, period.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.750
That's it, that's it.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.460
There should be no anything about that.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.250
So now it's, what are we gonna
do to make things better?

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.270
What are we gonna do to do
away with this systemic racism?

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.640
What are we gonna do to stop

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:15.230
these killings that are going on?

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.067
So we have to really, as
a country, come together

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:20.570
and really face these issues

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:24.820
that we've tried not to face
for so many generations.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:26.040
It's time.
- So many.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.210
- It's time, girl.

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.920
It's the perfect storm.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.400
We're gonna be uncomfortable.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.354
There's gonna be things

00:01:31.354 --> 00:01:32.700
that you don't know!
- And uncomfortable is okay.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.830
Uncomfortable is good.
- Yes, it's okay!

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:35.663
That's it.

00:01:35.663 --> 00:01:37.077
And if we could just be honest and say,

00:01:37.077 --> 00:01:38.617
"Oh, oh, shoot.

00:01:38.617 --> 00:01:39.677
"Is that not what I was?

00:01:39.677 --> 00:01:44.000
"Okay, let me listen, let
me learn, let me help."

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.860
But it's true.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.213
It's a very uncomfortable time.

00:01:48.482 --> 00:01:50.450
We just have to get into that uncomfort

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:51.340
and work through it,

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.510
and know that a better
thing is coming ahead of us.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.557
- Yeah, and you have to go,

00:01:55.557 --> 00:01:57.767
"Well, if I think it's uncomfortable,

00:01:57.767 --> 00:01:59.277
"imagine how uncomfortable they've been

00:01:59.277 --> 00:02:01.577
"being pushed around for years
- That's right.

00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:04.480
- "in generations."
- That's right, exactly.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.400
- Thank you for being honest about it

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.990
and not being afraid
to be honest about it.

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:12.470
I know that not everybody is comfortable

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:15.770
in this environment and
they lend their hand

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:19.730
and their money or their talent
or ears in their own ways.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.490
But it's really important, I think,

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.700
when we do have a
platform to say something.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.260
So thank you so much for
just being down-to-earth

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:30.553
and using your ears and your
heart and your platform.

